WEBVTT

00:19.370 --> 00:20.910
Fingerprint Authentication

00:26.550 --> 00:30.920
For the second selection, we're using mini-fields customized for the number of players.

00:31.380 --> 00:33.500
We've also set short targets.

00:33.500 --> 00:37.990
Your goalkeeper will be a Blue Lock Man, possessing the same skills as before.

00:38.470 --> 00:42.060
If you win, you choose a player from the opposing team and advance to the next stage.

00:38.930 --> 00:41.600
Our Blue Lock Man is white.

00:41.600 --> 00:43.600
Just like a video game character.

00:42.060 --> 00:45.560
If you lose, you lose a player and return to the previous stage.

00:43.600 --> 00:45.560
It's a great pleasure to work with you.

00:46.840 --> 00:48.690
A three-on-three match. First to five goals wins.

00:49.240 --> 00:52.620
Second Selection, Third Stage: The Rivalry Battle.

00:54.440 --> 00:57.030
It doesn't matter that our opponents are ranked higher.

00:57.290 --> 01:01.620
I want to test my skills against these guys ranked 1st, 2nd, and 3rd!

01:01.990 --> 01:07.230
I'll win and take Itoshi Rin for our team!

02:39.550 --> 02:43.010
Episode 13

02:43.550 --> 02:45.470
Second Selection

02:44.180 --> 02:45.470
Third Stage

02:52.620 --> 02:53.770
Here we go!

02:53.770 --> 02:56.570
Tokimitsu, you mark the one with bangs.

02:56.570 --> 02:58.490
What? Uh, okay.

02:58.490 --> 03:02.650
The numbers only reflect the order we cleared the first stage, right?

03:02.650 --> 03:04.020
Whoa! Scissors?

03:04.020 --> 03:05.120
So fast!

03:05.120 --> 03:07.160
Sorry. He got past me.

03:07.160 --> 03:10.500
I'm better thanks to my training with the Blue Lock Man.

03:10.500 --> 03:11.780
Nice, Bachira!

03:11.780 --> 03:14.370
Next up is Rin-chan. Ready, Isagi?

03:14.370 --> 03:15.090
Yeah!

03:15.360 --> 03:17.800
Come on, Bachira. Let's do a one-two pass.

03:17.800 --> 03:19.720
But this is a feint.

03:19.950 --> 03:20.720
Nagi.

03:20.720 --> 03:21.680
Yeah.

03:23.240 --> 03:24.630
I'm here.

03:25.100 --> 03:27.560
You can't get past me, glam boy.

03:31.940 --> 03:34.930
At this distance and with this timing...

03:34.930 --> 03:37.860
You're in range, Isagi.

03:37.860 --> 03:39.740
Awesome, Nagi.

03:40.110 --> 03:42.000
What an elegant pass.

03:42.000 --> 03:45.830
Focus on the game. Don't expend unnecessary effort.

03:46.450 --> 03:47.200
This...

03:48.030 --> 03:49.620
is my new direct shot!

03:54.670 --> 03:56.000
There you go!

03:56.000 --> 03:57.630
Yay!

03:57.630 --> 04:00.480
Isagi, I think your shots are getting more and more accurate.

04:00.480 --> 04:02.570
Yeah, they're much better now.

04:03.380 --> 04:07.390
Thanks to this training, I've definitely leveled up.

04:07.800 --> 04:13.010
Also, since we're familiar with each other, we can initiate the attacks we want.

04:08.370 --> 04:10.360
Good job, Nagicchi.

04:10.360 --> 04:13.010
Thanks for the pass, it was great.

04:13.010 --> 04:14.760
We're pretty good.

04:13.320 --> 04:15.610
Right? It's not even fun anymore.

04:14.760 --> 04:17.360
Jokes aside, we're seriously strong!

04:17.740 --> 04:18.990
Dude! What are we gonna do?

04:17.741 --> 04:19.720
We can beat these kids.

04:18.990 --> 04:20.820
That was a magnificent goal.

04:22.850 --> 04:25.780
All right. I get it now.

04:27.430 --> 04:31.690
You're so pathetic I could burst from boredom.

04:32.890 --> 04:39.290
I'd bet anything you think this game is just about kicking a ball.

04:39.670 --> 04:42.630
We seriously don't need people like you.

04:43.960 --> 04:45.770
This is a battle.

04:47.000 --> 04:51.850
What you're doing right now is turning your back on an armed man.

04:53.380 --> 04:55.790
That's why you're trash.

05:02.610 --> 05:05.110
From the kick-off?!

05:14.140 --> 05:15.640
Holy crap.

05:16.250 --> 05:18.020
Is that even allowed?

05:18.020 --> 05:19.210
Yeah, it's fine.

05:19.550 --> 05:21.920
But it's usually not done.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.970
A-A super goal?

05:23.970 --> 05:26.550
Hey, that was way too glam.

05:26.550 --> 05:29.140
Don't do anything without telling me.

05:29.660 --> 05:32.020
Like I said, I don't care.

05:32.460 --> 05:37.350
Friend or foe, you're all nothing to me.

05:37.950 --> 05:39.400
Let's finish this quickly.

05:39.810 --> 05:42.150
It's a waste of time.

05:42.770 --> 05:43.820
Wait a minute.

05:43.820 --> 05:46.630
We risked life and limb to be here.

05:47.090 --> 05:50.280
Aren't you playing soccer to realize your dream too?

05:51.670 --> 05:52.540
Dream?

05:52.950 --> 05:56.130
There's nothing as boring and empty as that.

05:56.610 --> 06:01.400
Losing in soccer means losing your reason for existing.

06:01.400 --> 06:04.060
In other words, it's the same as dying.

06:04.770 --> 06:08.970
For me, soccer is a fight to the death.

06:11.460 --> 06:13.190
A-A fight to the death?

06:13.190 --> 06:15.390
He must be a bit touched in the head.

06:15.390 --> 06:17.100
This guy's completely nuts.

06:17.370 --> 06:19.600
This guy seems like bad news.

06:20.150 --> 06:22.760
Let me just finish this.

06:22.760 --> 06:26.820
Your half-baked game ends here.

06:26.820 --> 06:28.780
Now you've pissed me off.

06:29.030 --> 06:30.790
Strange.

06:30.790 --> 06:32.990
Then let's fight to survive.

06:35.490 --> 06:39.500
Rin might be incredible, but this is a three-on-three team battle.

06:40.010 --> 06:44.170
I'll make him regret underestimating me and my team.

06:44.170 --> 06:45.590
Rin-chan...

06:46.450 --> 06:48.170
I won't let you touch the ball.

06:48.170 --> 06:51.140
Too soft. Nice pass, Bachira.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.360
To that height?

06:54.360 --> 06:55.680
He figured out the shot.

06:56.830 --> 06:58.890
Magnificent.

06:57.570 --> 06:59.900
I got it.

07:00.520 --> 07:05.520
Your game might be eye-catching, but if you can't play, you can't shine.

07:05.520 --> 07:10.240
I'm over 190 cm tall, and that was a magnificent leap.

07:10.240 --> 07:13.200
Tokimitsu, pass to me. Right in front of the goal.

07:10.890 --> 07:13.200
Huh? What? What?

07:13.450 --> 07:14.450
Aryu-kun!

07:14.670 --> 07:15.580
He got in front of me!

07:15.580 --> 07:16.450
It went over there.

07:16.750 --> 07:17.910
Great block, Bachira!

07:19.350 --> 07:22.460
If I lose the ball in a situation like this, there's no coming back.

07:22.460 --> 07:24.420
I should be cautious for now.

07:26.670 --> 07:30.010
Even though I was protecting the ball, did he manage to steal it from me?

07:32.470 --> 07:34.300
From that position?

07:35.410 --> 07:39.430
Usually that's a foul and I'd win, but how long are this guy's legs?

07:39.860 --> 07:43.520
With his incredible leaps and genes better than an average Japanese...

07:43.520 --> 07:48.730
Aryu... is no different from a monster!

07:45.400 --> 07:47.610
Magnificent.

07:49.400 --> 07:54.700
Right now, I am the most glamorous person on this pitch.

07:54.700 --> 07:58.570
I'm sorry. I never expected him to shoot from there.

07:58.570 --> 08:02.160
No problem. That long-legged guy is a total nutjob, right?

08:03.240 --> 08:04.950
These are really tough opponents.

08:06.360 --> 08:07.840
Pass it to me, Isagi.

08:09.190 --> 08:10.370
How can we start an attack?

08:10.370 --> 08:11.170
Hm?

08:11.170 --> 08:13.970
If passes aren't reaching Nagicchi...

08:15.040 --> 08:16.470
I'll get past them myself!

08:16.470 --> 08:18.180
Wait, what?

08:18.180 --> 08:20.140
Come on, try to stop me, weird eyebrows!

08:20.560 --> 08:24.020
Oh no. I have to stop you. Are you coming at me now too?

08:24.020 --> 08:26.480
I think so. Your feet can't move.

08:27.290 --> 08:28.980
What should I do?

08:28.980 --> 08:32.190
If I lose now, I'll become useless again.

08:32.900 --> 08:34.920
I've come this far.

08:34.920 --> 08:38.120
I finally gained a little self-confidence thanks to soccer.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.830
Dude, no, no. I don't want it to be like this.

08:39.830 --> 08:43.080
I'm thinking negatively again. I hate myself when I'm like this.

08:44.150 --> 08:46.420
I want to relax!

08:46.630 --> 08:47.920
Did he accelerate?

08:48.180 --> 08:50.170
I can still pass him.

08:51.610 --> 08:53.130
I didn't like that!

08:55.090 --> 08:57.840
What? I had passed him.

08:58.090 --> 08:59.220
In that case...

08:59.220 --> 09:00.910
I'll leave him in the dust!

09:03.100 --> 09:05.520
He got past Bachira in a one-on-one?

09:05.520 --> 09:07.370
He's reacting too quickly.

09:07.370 --> 09:09.480
His speed is out of the ordinary!

09:09.480 --> 09:11.780
This isn't good at all. I want to score.

09:11.940 --> 09:13.610
I feel terrible when I don't score.

09:13.610 --> 09:15.700
Goal, goal, goal!

09:15.700 --> 09:16.850
Did he go crazy?

09:16.850 --> 09:18.160
Stop him, Isagi.

09:19.140 --> 09:20.450
Get out of my way!

09:21.950 --> 09:24.330
Left? Right? Which way?

09:24.330 --> 09:26.160
Damn it! If I have to foul, I will!

09:27.620 --> 09:29.510
What is this power?

09:30.330 --> 09:32.840
This guy is like a bullet made of muscle!

09:33.220 --> 09:34.800
There we go.

09:38.750 --> 09:40.500
What happened to this guy?

09:41.100 --> 09:43.260
Yay, I did it!

09:42.770 --> 09:45.100
Are these kids human?

09:43.260 --> 09:45.100
Oh sorry, I shouldn't be happy.

09:45.100 --> 09:49.060
If I get carried away, people will hate me and I'll lose all of this.

09:46.140 --> 09:49.060
New BL Rankings

09:49.060 --> 09:52.330
Tokimitsu, are you a psychopath?

09:50.150 --> 09:55.030
New BL Rankings

09:52.330 --> 09:55.030
According to the new Blue Lock rankings...

09:55.030 --> 09:57.550
Hurry up and start.

09:57.110 --> 09:59.990
New BL Rankings

09:57.550 --> 09:59.550
This is the power of the top three!

10:00.630 --> 10:04.680
Rin wasn't the only one with extraordinary weapons.

10:05.200 --> 10:07.280
Ah, this is terrible!

10:05.750 --> 10:10.590
I mean, these guys just met and have zero teamwork.

10:07.280 --> 10:09.560
You're not glamorous at all.

10:09.560 --> 10:12.050
What am I going to do?

10:10.590 --> 10:13.860
They fight separately, using their individual skills.

10:12.620 --> 10:14.220
I'm telling you, you're not glamorous at all.

10:14.220 --> 10:18.130
Compared to them, we fought side by side in the same building.

10:14.221 --> 10:15.960
I'm completely ruined!

10:18.600 --> 10:21.470
Even though we're a team.

10:21.960 --> 10:24.960
So why?

10:24.960 --> 10:26.870
Why did it turn out like this?

10:28.660 --> 10:32.390
Does this mean we're going to lose?

10:33.400 --> 10:36.670
Wow. So there are still forwards like that.

10:38.420 --> 10:41.110
Soccer really is incredibly interesting.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.110
Nagi...

10:43.730 --> 10:47.450
It's thanks to you that I can see things this way, Isagi.

10:49.530 --> 10:53.030
I promise I'll make it even more interesting next time.

11:03.010 --> 11:06.190
Are they making a plan?

11:06.190 --> 11:09.710
No way. This time, something's really going to happen. I know it.

11:10.330 --> 11:15.070
So Nagicchi wants the three of us to play like this.

11:15.070 --> 11:18.130
Yeah. I think it'll be interesting.

11:18.130 --> 11:21.910
After all, we have to do something. What do you think, Isagi?

11:21.910 --> 11:26.020
I'm in too. This might be the best way against these three.

11:26.580 --> 11:31.870
But Nagi, I never thought you were the type to suggest ideas and stuff.

11:32.350 --> 11:34.580
I wasn't. This is my first time.

11:35.130 --> 11:39.550
I never want to lose and feel like that again.

11:40.680 --> 11:42.680
Winning is no fun when you lose.

11:43.010 --> 11:44.510
Isn't that right?

11:44.940 --> 11:46.970
Yeah. Let's get started!

11:50.030 --> 11:51.440
First to five goals wins.

11:51.440 --> 11:54.150
If they score two more, we lose.

11:54.440 --> 12:00.240
Nagi can't move because of Aryu's incredible jumping and long legs.

12:00.240 --> 12:02.030
The same goes for Bachira.

12:02.030 --> 12:06.530
His dribbling weapon is useless against Tokimitsu's extraordinary agility.

12:07.030 --> 12:10.440
If things keep going like this, we'll lose.

12:11.080 --> 12:16.520
We'll keep a 15-meter distance between us, so we can play together.

12:16.980 --> 12:19.370
And we can use this triangle to beat them.

12:19.980 --> 12:21.300
Bachira is the connection point.

12:21.630 --> 12:26.720
He'll determine the route that takes our triangle to the goal.

12:27.600 --> 12:34.060
But we can't hold the ball for long, so Isagi and I will stay on defense.

12:34.620 --> 12:41.970
This will only work if my play and Isagi's direct shot are perfectly accurate.

12:41.970 --> 12:42.900
This will work!

12:42.900 --> 12:46.490
As Nagi pointed out, if we can't win one-on-one battles,

12:46.490 --> 12:49.190
we need to create three-on-three situations.

12:49.190 --> 12:50.450
This way,

12:51.370 --> 12:53.160
we can control the midfield!

12:53.160 --> 12:55.860
They've started passing the ball around.

12:55.860 --> 12:57.630
I'll stop them with my own style.

12:57.860 --> 13:00.960
But with Aryu behind me, I can't make the final touch on this move.

13:00.960 --> 13:02.420
You'll do it, Isagi.

13:02.860 --> 13:05.020
When we reach the penalty area,

13:05.020 --> 13:10.810
use your eyes to measure the timing and range, and run to where you'll take the shot.

13:10.810 --> 13:11.890
I'm starting to see it now!

13:11.890 --> 13:13.850
There! It's open!

13:13.850 --> 13:16.060
All right, partner. Here's the spot you wanted!

13:18.130 --> 13:19.940
This is a half-baked team play.

13:21.150 --> 13:26.360
Did you think I wouldn't see what you're seeing?

13:26.360 --> 13:30.090
Rin? Seriously? Did he see where I wanted to shoot from?

13:30.090 --> 13:31.080
You've got to be kidding.

13:31.080 --> 13:32.360
He stopped him!

13:32.360 --> 13:33.370
Then...

13:33.370 --> 13:34.080
Nagi!

13:34.470 --> 13:36.330
A quick ground pass.

13:36.330 --> 13:40.440
But this won't work since I can no longer be a part of the triangle.

13:40.440 --> 13:41.250
Ah.

13:41.250 --> 13:43.710
That's right. I feel it.

13:43.920 --> 13:46.050
A gift from me to you.

13:46.470 --> 13:50.510
The ball is spinning incredibly. Interesting.

13:50.770 --> 13:53.570
It's like it's telling me something.

13:53.570 --> 13:55.560
I feel the same way.

13:55.560 --> 13:56.520
Bingo.

13:57.060 --> 13:58.480
Wow.

13:59.090 --> 14:02.440
This is the meeting of talents.

14:03.850 --> 14:06.390
This is the chemical reaction between Nagi and Bachira!

14:07.620 --> 14:10.780
Only forwards who dominate the chemical reaction between ego and self

14:10.780 --> 14:13.580
will earn the right to advance to the next stage.

14:13.580 --> 14:15.730
Well done, Nagi and Bachira.

14:15.730 --> 14:20.380
I never expected that. Could Nagi always pass like that?

14:21.380 --> 14:26.380
Reo's passes were always a "do whatever you want" kind of thing.

14:26.990 --> 14:29.590
But Bachira's pass...

14:29.850 --> 14:33.310
It felt like it was giving me advice.

14:33.310 --> 14:35.020
Isn't that something amazing?

14:35.020 --> 14:37.730
Yeah. How many more times are we going to do it?

14:38.130 --> 14:42.690
We'll use the triangle to control the midfield, and then I'll make a move.

14:43.290 --> 14:47.930
We scored a goal with Bachira's passes and Nagi's intuition.

14:48.240 --> 14:50.530
This is our plan!

14:48.750 --> 14:50.530
Alright, one more time.

14:50.530 --> 14:52.450
Okay, I got it.

14:52.450 --> 14:55.130
So, what we're going to do now is—

14:55.130 --> 14:57.410
Are you chatting on the battlefield?

14:58.550 --> 15:01.330
Haven't you learned anything?

15:04.630 --> 15:08.090
I'm risking my life for every single moment here.

15:09.260 --> 15:10.220
Damn it.

15:10.220 --> 15:11.590
Yay! Another goal!

15:17.220 --> 15:20.730
The only thing I can do is see the future and sense danger!

15:21.160 --> 15:22.190
Isagi!

15:22.680 --> 15:27.190
You know, I see what you see.

15:27.190 --> 15:29.990
You're just like me, Itoshi Rin.

15:31.000 --> 15:35.220
Weapons, playing styles... I know them all!

15:35.610 --> 15:39.580
From now on, I'll control the field with these eyes!

15:40.100 --> 15:41.290
Ball to the red team.

15:41.760 --> 15:43.660
Restart with a corner kick.

15:43.250 --> 15:45.000
Corner kick

15:43.410 --> 15:45.000
Itoshi Rin

15:47.320 --> 15:50.790
Bachira is marking Tokimitsu, who is very good at getting past people.

15:47.830 --> 15:49.090
Move aside, please.

15:49.090 --> 15:50.010
No way!

15:50.340 --> 15:50.790
They're playing everything according to me.

15:50.790 --> 15:53.680
Nagi is also marking Aryu, who is good in the air.

15:52.210 --> 15:53.680
You're too much.

15:53.680 --> 15:58.090
The position I have to take is right here, so I can block either one.

15:58.090 --> 16:02.140
This is perfect if I want to restrict their passing options.

16:02.380 --> 16:05.270
We'll overcome this crisis and find a way to counter.

16:05.820 --> 16:09.570
I'll turn this crisis into an opportunity!

16:11.720 --> 16:13.530
So high. To Aryu?

16:14.360 --> 16:17.070
No! To our head?

16:18.330 --> 16:21.000
A direct shot with a vertical spin?

16:25.910 --> 16:30.230
This kid just scored a goal straight from a corner kick.

16:33.260 --> 16:35.580
Wow, th-that's incredible.

16:35.580 --> 16:38.890
You did something even more glamorous than me.

16:39.110 --> 16:40.910
This is so irrational.

16:41.980 --> 16:44.350
How can we stop this?

16:44.350 --> 16:47.000
Damn it. Did I misjudge the situation?

16:47.000 --> 16:50.960
If I had been standing at the far post, could I have stopped it?

16:50.960 --> 16:53.980
No, that would have left the area I'm in now completely open.

16:53.980 --> 16:56.840
For me, that was the only logical position.

16:57.150 --> 16:59.640
If they score one more, we lose.

17:00.020 --> 17:00.950
Damn it.

17:00.950 --> 17:04.710
We need to score three more goals.

17:05.080 --> 17:07.250
Yeah, it's time to do something.

17:07.890 --> 17:12.360
This game can't end here!

17:16.300 --> 17:17.230
Great!

17:17.230 --> 17:20.470
We can control the midfield with our triangle.

17:20.470 --> 17:23.310
The only thing we need is an idea to complete the move.

17:23.690 --> 17:27.230
Just now, Rin understood my last pass.

17:27.230 --> 17:30.360
We managed to score a goal thanks to the chemical reaction between Nagi and Bachira,

17:30.360 --> 17:33.280
but a goal like that doesn't happen very often.

17:33.740 --> 17:37.280
This time, I have to create a chemical reaction.

17:37.800 --> 17:39.990
What can I do?

17:39.990 --> 17:42.490
How much longer are you going to pass the ball around?

17:42.490 --> 17:45.630
You call yourself a forward?

17:46.870 --> 17:49.630
Come on. I'll finish you off.

17:50.120 --> 17:51.970
Don't underestimate me, Rin.

17:51.970 --> 17:56.420
If you mess around with me this much, you'll leave a big gap behind you.

17:56.420 --> 17:57.980
Bachira!

17:57.980 --> 17:58.890
Over here!

18:00.510 --> 18:03.680
I'll create the smell of a goal myself!

18:03.680 --> 18:05.850
Did you find a good area?

18:06.220 --> 18:11.690
Go find a book on how the human eye works and learn something, you piece of trash.

18:11.920 --> 18:14.150
What?

18:14.460 --> 18:16.880
I thought I had gotten behind him.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.070
What is he doing here?

18:18.390 --> 18:19.610
He shouldn't be here.

18:20.030 --> 18:23.790
The only thing I can think of is that he read me somehow.

18:24.030 --> 18:24.850
Are you serious?

18:24.850 --> 18:25.500
Nagi!

18:25.500 --> 18:26.960
Yeah, I'll stop him.

18:27.180 --> 18:31.880
But how did he figure it out so fast? How did he predict my move—

18:32.130 --> 18:37.010
Did you think I wouldn't see what you're seeing?

18:38.450 --> 18:43.720
Maybe the goal I smelled earlier wasn't a real goal,

18:44.220 --> 18:48.940
but I was tricked into thinking it was, so I took that position.

18:49.450 --> 18:54.760
Was I pulled into the future of the space Rin created?

18:55.080 --> 18:56.750
This is really bad!

18:56.750 --> 19:00.990
I wasn't controlling the field! He was controlling it!

19:00.990 --> 19:02.950
Bachira! Nagi!

19:02.950 --> 19:04.410
Stop him!

19:05.290 --> 19:07.500
Are we going to lose? No way!

19:08.050 --> 19:09.990
No! I...

19:10.550 --> 19:17.420
I can't even begin to estimate the size of the gap between my skills and Rin's.

19:18.100 --> 19:22.630
The difference is just that overwhelming and sad.

19:23.030 --> 19:25.390
So why...

19:27.080 --> 19:29.530
Even though we're on the verge of losing,

19:29.950 --> 19:33.560
my eyes and my heart were captivated

19:36.550 --> 19:41.380
by the beautiful arc Rin's shot drew in the air.

19:48.370 --> 19:52.000
Third stage, three-on-three Rivalry Battle,

19:52.000 --> 19:54.960
the Red Team won 5-2.

19:54.960 --> 19:58.170
Now, who shall we choose?

19:57.150 --> 19:58.170
How exciting.

19:58.440 --> 20:01.380
I don't care. It won't make any difference.

20:02.210 --> 20:06.300
Honestly, my brain couldn't even compute this moment.

20:07.190 --> 20:10.860
Aryu-kun, I think we should choose him.

20:11.500 --> 20:15.140
What a coincidence. I want him too.

20:15.140 --> 20:18.620
I never realized what we could lose.

20:18.620 --> 20:19.730
Join us...

20:20.010 --> 20:21.560
Bachira Meguru.

20:24.070 --> 20:26.820
Y-You have great passes.

20:26.820 --> 20:31.000
Our team is only good at individual skills, so if you join, we'll be even stronger!

20:31.000 --> 20:32.930
I got carried away again.

20:32.930 --> 20:34.080
Please don't hate me.

20:34.080 --> 20:37.380
Help my magnificent goals.

20:37.380 --> 20:41.800
Be my stage director, Bachira Meguru.

20:41.800 --> 20:44.060
Both of you have said enough.

20:44.630 --> 20:46.510
Let's go.

20:46.510 --> 20:48.550
Hurry up, Bowl Cut.

20:49.240 --> 20:52.230
The future is in our hands.

20:55.750 --> 21:01.150
Ah, man. I wanted to be on Isagi's team until the very end.

21:01.450 --> 21:02.660
Bachira.

21:03.510 --> 21:06.140
I guess I'm going. That's the rule.

21:08.580 --> 21:11.960
But I won't wait for you, Isagi.

21:12.380 --> 21:15.000
If you want me, come and get me.

21:17.380 --> 21:21.320
I'm going to follow the monster inside me.

21:23.570 --> 21:31.930
From now on, I'll have to chase after what I've lost to get it back.

21:32.830 --> 21:38.200
In this Blue Lock, full of egoists.

21:38.310 --> 21:44.030
Second Selection

21:40.060 --> 21:44.030
Nagi Seishiro + Isagi Yoichi Defeated

23:14.540 --> 23:18.040
Blue Lock, Extra Time.

23:18.040 --> 23:21.420
Form a 3-person team and proceed

23:18.080 --> 23:21.020
The Secret Story Behind the "Top 3" Team

23:19.020 --> 23:21.420
No way! What am I gonna do?

23:21.420 --> 23:24.290
Do I have to be in a three-person team to pass this stage?

23:22.250 --> 23:28.050
Tokimitsu Aoishi

23:24.290 --> 23:28.050
No one will want to team up with me!

23:28.050 --> 23:29.000
Hm?

23:28.130 --> 23:33.140
Aryu Jyubei

23:29.000 --> 23:33.140
For someone who passed the first stage third, you're not very glamorous.

23:33.140 --> 23:34.490
Magnificent?

23:34.490 --> 23:36.090
What is this long-haired guy talking about?

23:36.090 --> 23:40.170
I was wondering who I would team up with too.

23:40.170 --> 23:42.590
Those in the top three will form a team!

23:42.590 --> 23:45.610
It's the most glamorous and noble thing to do.

23:43.900 --> 23:45.480
Magnificent.

23:45.610 --> 23:49.570
It's a nice offer, but he's definitely a weird one.

23:49.570 --> 23:51.980
I'd rather not team up with him.

23:54.990 --> 23:56.440
I should politely decline.

23:56.440 --> 24:01.020
Actually, I'm not that good.

24:01.020 --> 24:03.750
I passed the last stage by coincidence.

24:03.750 --> 24:05.730
Is that true?

24:05.730 --> 24:07.960
That's enough.

24:07.960 --> 24:10.840
You'll team up and play with me!

24:10.920 --> 24:14.510
Itoshi Rin

24:11.060 --> 24:14.520
Shut up and come here. You're wasting my time.

24:14.520 --> 24:18.260
He's even worse!

24:19.270 --> 24:21.130
N-Nice to meet you.

24:21.130 --> 24:24.290
Being sensible is glamorous.

24:24.270 --> 24:27.520
Rin + Aryu + Tokimitsu
formed a team